WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:13.623
Roxy poked her head into the computer center.

2
00:00:13.624 --> 00:00:15.907
"I'll be back soon, Miss Apricot.

3
00:00:15.908 --> 00:00:18.660
I need to help Principal Penn."

4
00:00:18.661 --> 00:00:20.749
Roxy glanced at Terrell and nodded.

5
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.065
He nodded back.

6
00:00:23.066 --> 00:00:28.655
Then Roxy ran out of the school and shot into the air.

7
00:00:28.656 --> 00:00:32.061
She found Detective Smith inside Metro City Central Bank.

8
00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:34.284
The door to the bank safe was open.

9
00:00:34.285 --> 00:00:36.402
The detective was knocking on it.

10
00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:40.225
Roxy grinned. "The door is open, Detective.

11
00:00:40.226 --> 00:00:42.531
You don't have to knock."

12
00:00:42.532 --> 00:00:46.588
"Very funny, Rocket Girl." Detective Smith frowned.

13
00:00:46.589 --> 00:00:49.838
"I'm wondering how the thief got into the safe."

14
00:00:49.839 --> 00:00:52.883
The bank teller stood behind Detective Smith.

15
00:00:52.884 --> 00:00:55.129
"It doesn't make any sense.

16
00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.064
The safe isn't broken.

17
00:00:57.065 --> 00:00:59.346
There's no hole in the wall.

18
00:00:59.347 --> 00:01:02.753
I don't understand how someone stole the money!"

19
00:01:02.754 --> 00:01:06.398
"Did you see anyone suspicious?" Roxy asked.

20
00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.385
The teller shook his head.

21
00:01:08.386 --> 00:01:12.170
"There are no clues," Detective Smith said.

22
00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:17.113
"This is very odd." Just then his phone rang.

23
00:01:17.114 --> 00:01:20.982
"Hello? Uh-oh. We're on our way!"

24
00:01:20.983 --> 00:01:22.908
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

25
00:01:22.909 --> 00:01:24.795
"True Savings Bank was just robbed.

26
00:01:24.796 --> 00:01:28.576
We need to—Rocket Girl?"

27
00:01:28.577 --> 00:01:33.552
Zoom! Roxy flew to True Savings Bank and rushed inside.

28
00:01:33.553 --> 00:01:35.353
A woman ran over.

29
00:01:35.354 --> 00:01:38.592
"Rocket Girl! I'm glad you're here.

30
00:01:38.593 --> 00:01:41.412
I'm Mrs. Betz, the bank manager.

31
00:01:41.413 --> 00:01:44.013
We were just robbed!"

32
00:01:44.014 --> 00:01:46.692
"Yes, I know," Roxy said.

33
00:01:46.693 --> 00:01:48.730
"Did you see the robber?"

34
00:01:48.731 --> 00:01:52.461
Mrs. Betz nodded. "I saw her escape."

35
00:01:52.462 --> 00:01:54.634
Roxy ran back to the door.

36
00:01:54.635 --> 00:01:56.578
"Which way did she go?"

37
00:01:56.579 --> 00:02:01.885
Mrs. Betz sighed. "She didn't go out the door. She—"

38
00:02:01.886 --> 00:02:06.139
Detective Smith ran into the bank. "Are we too late?"

39
00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:11.213
"Yes," Roxy said. "But luckily, Mrs. Betz saw the robber."

40
00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:13.506
Roxy turned back to the bank manager.

41
00:02:13.507 --> 00:02:16.085
"Tell us what you saw."

42
00:02:16.086 --> 00:02:21.450
Mrs. Betz led Roxy and Detective Smith into a safe.

43
00:02:21.451 --> 00:02:24.956
"It sounds ridiculous," she said.

44
00:02:24.957 --> 00:02:29.965
"But there was a spinning, glowing hole right here in the wall.

45
00:02:29.966 --> 00:02:33.967
A woman was grabbing money and throwing it into the hole.

46
00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:37.234
I told her to stop, but she ignored me.

47
00:02:37.235 --> 00:02:39.585
She threw the rest of the money in.

48
00:02:39.586 --> 00:02:44.665
Then she jumped into the hole, and the hole disappeared.

49
00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:48.182
Now it's a solid wall again."

50
00:02:48.183 --> 00:02:51.251
"Hmm." Roxy knocked on the wall.

51
00:02:51.252 --> 00:02:53.437
"Maybe it was a wormhole."

52
00:02:53.438 --> 00:02:55.987
"Huh?" Detective Smith said.

53
00:02:55.988 --> 00:02:58.465
"A wormhole," Roxy said.

54
00:02:58.466 --> 00:03:00.793
"It's like a tunnel through space.

55
00:03:00.794 --> 00:03:03.406
It connects two different places.

56
00:03:03.407 --> 00:03:06.373
I didn't think wormholes were real though."

57
00:03:06.374 --> 00:03:08.802
Detective Smith's phone rang again.

58
00:03:08.803 --> 00:03:13.677
"Hello?" As he listened, the color drained from his face.

59
00:03:13.678 --> 00:03:16.109
He hung up the phone and looked at Roxy.

60
00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.201
Detective Smith swallowed.

61
00:03:18.202 --> 00:03:23.577
"Every bank in Metro City has been robbed!"
